        "original_id": "6397ce01-61be-52ec-b2cf-5344aafd71d2",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: George Roby Dempster, Cas Walker, Guy Smith Jr., Thomas Dempster, John Dempster\n- Organizations: Knoxville Journal, Dempster Brothers\n- Places: Knoxville, Tennessee\n- Roles: city manager, mayor, businessman, politician, editor\n\nFacts:\n- George Roby Dempster originally established Dempster Brothers with his brothers Thomas Dempster and John Dempster.\n- Orton Caswell \"Cas\" Walker was born on March 23, 1902, and became a Tennessee businessman, politician, and television and radio personality.\n- George Roby Dempster served as city manager and mayor of Knoxville.\n- In Knoxville, George Roby Dempster became legendary for political battles with businessman Cas Walker and Knoxville Journal editor Guy Smith Jr.\n- Orton Caswell \"Cas\" Walker died on September 25, 1998.",
